@startuml
title Replay log review and cleanup

start
:Imported log is waiting;
:Codex analysis task claims replay and fingerprint;
:Read the managed JSONL and linked validated map;
:Record examined after actual examination;
:Record done after analysis completes;
if (Other active reviewers?) then (yes)
  :Keep waiting log and manifest record;
else (no)
  :Mark log done;
  :Verify managed path and output checksum;
  :Delete JSONL and its manifest record;
  :Retain map file, registration and replay association;
  :Retain retired fingerprint to prevent reimport;
endif
stop

@enduml
